    privacyTitle: "🔒 Privacy notice",
    privacyBody: "<p><strong>Data controller:</strong> Marco Lestan, reachable at <a href=\"mailto:marcolestan@gelateriaingredienti.com\">marcolestan@gelateriaingredienti.com</a>.</p><p><strong>Data collected:</strong> company name, contact email address, type of business and optional message, entered voluntarily through the \"Join us\" form.</p><p><strong>Information request:</strong> if you use the \"Request information\" form on a product, we collect the gelato shop name, contact email, phone number and optional notes (e.g. request details), together with the selected product and manufacturer. This data is shared with the indicated manufacturer, solely to handle the information request.</p><p><strong>Feedback:</strong> if you use the \"Leave feedback\" form, we collect the message entered and, only if you voluntarily provide them, your name, company/gelato shop and contact email.</p><p><strong>Purpose:</strong> responding to the request to add products to the portal and managing the communications necessary for that purpose.</p><p><strong>Legal basis:</strong> performance of pre-contractual measures requested by the data subject (Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR), triggered voluntarily by submitting the form.</p><p><strong>Recipients and data transfer:</strong> the form is technically handled through Netlify, Inc., the website's hosting provider, which acts as data processor. Processing may also take place on servers located in the United States, in compliance with the standard contractual clauses approved by the European Commission. The data is not shared with third parties for commercial or marketing purposes.</p><p><strong>Retention:</strong> the data is kept for as long as necessary to handle the request and any subsequent relationship with your company.</p><p><strong>Data subject rights:</strong> you may at any time request access, rectification, erasure or restriction of the processing of your data by writing to the address above, and you have the right to lodge a complaint with the competent data protection authority.</p><p><strong>Analytics cookies (Google Analytics and Microsoft Clarity):</strong> if you give consent via the cookie banner, the portal uses Google Analytics and Microsoft Clarity to collect anonymous, aggregated usage statistics (pages visited, traffic source, visit duration, heatmaps and anonymous session recordings) in order to improve the service. This data is processed by Google Ireland Limited and by Microsoft Ireland Operations Limited, also on servers located in the United States, in compliance with the standard contractual clauses approved by the European Commission. You can withdraw consent at any time via your browser settings or by deleting cookies; if you decline or withdraw consent, the portal continues to work normally without any limitation.</p>",
